ionMarkdownView","markdown":"从「虚拟权限」插件独立出来的通知权限伪装插件。\n\n使关闭了通知权限的 App 认为已开启通知，不再出现建议开启通知权限的弹窗。App 正常开启通知权限时不会被拦截，通知提醒正常放行。\n\n## 功能\n\n- 按 App 伪装通知权限，关闭通知的 App 认为已开启。\n- App 正常开启通知权限时不被拦截，通知提醒正常放行。\n- 授权状态、横幅、声音、角标、通知中心、锁屏、预览与横幅样式按已授权返回。\n- 不修改系统真实通知设置，不伪造 APNs token。\n\n## 兼容\n\n- iOS 15 及以上版本越狱\n- rootless / roothide\n- 巨魔注入 / 证书自签\n\n## 使用\n\n- 越狱环境：安装后在桌面打开「通知权限伪装」进行配置。\n- 巨魔 / 自签：将 dylib 注入目标 App，默认生效，无需配置。\n\n已经允许的通知仍可能投递；要停止接收，请在系统设置中关闭该 App 的通知。","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"### 安装说明\n\n- 越狱环境：安装后在桌面打开「通知权限伪装」进行配置。\n- 巨魔 / 自签：将 dylib 注入目标 App，默认生效，无需配置。","useSpacing":true},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"### 已知冲突\n\n- 不要在「虚拟权限」中对同一个 App 同时开启通知虚拟。","useSpacing":true}]},{"tabname":"更新日志","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://tongzhi.goforit.si/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/tongzhi","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdev","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 频道","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdevchat","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 群组","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.2","text":"2026-10-18"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"- 优化 iOS 15 设备的管理 App 启动兼容性。\n- 插件反馈改为打开专属反馈页面。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.1","text":"2026-10-18"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"- 修复主页面文字重叠。\n- 调整赞赏入口，直接打开支付宝并支持网页回退。\n- 源地址改为在浏览器打开，简化版本信息展示。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.0","text":"2026-10-18"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"首个公开版本：按 App 伪装通知权限；关闭通知的 App 认为已开启，正常开启通知的 App 不被拦截；支持 rootless、roothide、巨魔注入与证书自签。"}]}]}
